      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_00",
      "hash64": "93A3B6F57DD8E5EF",
      "text": "Hallo! Ich bin’s, Onay.[VAR 0x0114(0054)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0054"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_01",
      "hash64": "93A3B5F57DD8E43C",
      "text": "Ich danke dir, dass du so viele Leute an die\\nBlaubeer-Akademie gerufen hast.[VAR 0x0114(0054)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0054"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_02",
      "hash64": "93A3B8F57DD8E955",
      "text": "Dafür hast du dir ein ganz besonderes Geschenk\\nverdient.[VAR 0x0114(0054)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0054"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_03",
      "hash64": "93A3B7F57DD8E7A2",
      "text": "Und zwar das Recht, gegen den [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Geheimboss[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\nder Blaubeer-Akademie anzutreten![VAR 0x0114(0054)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0054"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_04",
      "hash64": "93A3B2F57DD8DF23",
      "text": "Also komm doch bitte gleich mal zum\\nEingangsbereich.[VAR 0x0114(0054)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0054"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_05",
      "hash64": "93A3B1F57DD8DD70",
      "text": "Er kann es kaum erwarten! Also dann, bis nachher.[VAR 0x0114(0054)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0054"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_06",
      "hash64": "93A3B4F57DD8E289",
      "text": "Nanu? [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_07",
      "hash64": "93A3B3F57DD8E0D6",
      "text": "Was machst du hier? Wartest du auf jemanden?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_select_01",
      "hash64": "A1EED9B4A0548D8B",
      "text": "Ja, und zwar auf den Geheimboss.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_select_02",
      "hash64": "A1EEDAB4A0548F3E",
      "text": "Ich wurde herbestellt...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_08",
      "hash64": "93A3BEF57DD8F387",
      "text": "Verstehe![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_09",
      "hash64": "93A3BDF57DD8F1D4",
      "text": "Dann wird es wohl Zeit, die Scharade endgültig\\nzu beenden...[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_10",
      "hash64": "93A030F57DD5CC66",
      "text": "Du wirst es nicht glauben, aber Onay bin in\\nWirklichkeit ich![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_11",
      "hash64": "93A031F57DD5CE19",
      "text": "Dank dir ist richtig Leben in unsere Akademie\\ngekommen.\\c\\nDu hast für ordentlich Inspiration gesorgt,\\nsowohl bei den Leuten als auch den AGs![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_12",
      "hash64": "93A02EF57DD5C900",
      "text": "Als Direktor bin ich dir dafür wirklich sehr\\ndankbar.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_13",
      "hash64": "93A02FF57DD5CAB3",
      "text": "Und, jetzt halt dich fest. Ich bin nicht nur der\\nDirektor...[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_14",
      "hash64": "93A034F57DD5D332",
      "text": "Ich bin auch der stärkste Trainer der\\nBlaubeer-Akademie, der Geheimboss![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_15",
      "hash64": "93A035F57DD5D4E5",
      "text": "Der Champ der Blaubeer-Liga mag öffentlich\\ndie Nummer Eins sein, aber im Hintergrund ist\\r\\nder Geheimboss der Stärkste.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_16",
      "hash64": "93A032F57DD5CFCC",
      "text": "Gegen dich macht ein Kampf bestimmt auch\\nso richtig Spaß.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_17",
      "hash64": "93A033F57DD5D17F",
      "text": "Dann lass uns gleich mal loslegen...[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_18",
      "hash64": "93A038F57DD5D9FE",
      "text": "Ich werde Ernst machen, also halte schön lange\\ndurch, ja?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_19",
      "hash64": "93A039F57DD5DBB1",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Mensch, du bist wirklich stark,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\r\\nDas war\\r\\nmeine\\r\\nerste\\r\\nNiederlage\\r\\nseit\\r\\nJahren![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
