        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_20",
      "hash64": "939CCAF57DD2E93D",
      "text": "Also gut, der Champ der Blaubeer-Liga hat den\\nGeheimboss besiegt. Dann bist du jetzt...[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_21",
      "hash64": "939CC9F57DD2E78A",
      "text": "Wie sollen wir dich nennen? Hmmm...\\nBlaubeer-König vielleicht?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_21b",
      "hash64": "A6531424CD600F38",
      "text": "Wie sollen wir dich nennen? Hmmm...\\nBlaubeer-Königin vielleicht?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_select_03",
      "hash64": "A1EEDBB4A05490F1",
      "text": "Das gefällt mir!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_select_04",
      "hash64": "A1EEDCB4A05492A4",
      "text": "Hm, na ja...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_22",
      "hash64": "939CC8F57DD2E5D7",
      "text": "Aber genug von deinem Titel. Glückwunsch\\njedenfalls![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_23",
      "hash64": "939CC7F57DD2E424",
      "text": "Dafür, dass du den Geheimboss besiegt hast,\\nbekommst du einen besonderen Preis.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "8E3ED08217B878F9",
      "text": "Ach, ich bin so gut drauf, ich möchte dir noch\\nmehr geben...[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "8E3ECF8217B87746",
      "text": "Ich hab’s! Wie wär’s mit einem Pokémon-Tausch?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "8E3ECE8217B87593",
      "text": "Ja, lass uns tauschen. Ich biete ein Elezeba an.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "8E3ECD8217B873E0",
      "text": "Solange es von dir kommt, bin ich mit jedem\\nPokémon zufrieden.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_trade_01_04",
      "hash64": "8E3ED48217B87FC5",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0101(0001)]... Das ist toll. Danke!\\c\\nMein Elezeba hat eine seltene Farbe. Ist das nicht\\nfantastisch? Kümmere dich gut um es![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
